                <pb facs="0321" n="237" xml:id="pg237"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Malmros.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3, 1903</hi></date>.
                        (Sent 10.30 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>If dispatch to <hi rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> has not been delivered
                    inform her captain immediately that she must prevent Government troops departing
                    for Panama or taking any action which would lead to bloodshed, and must use
                    every endeavor to preserve order on Isthmus.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
